  "title": "The Beatles meditate with Maharishi Mahesh Yogi in London | 1967",
  "date": "1967-08-31",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>The Beatles attended a meditation session with Maharishi Mahesh Yogi in London, on the evening of 31 August 1967. <span id=\"more-129278\"></span></p><p>The band first met Maharishi on <a href=\"/1967/08/24/the-beatles-meet-maharishi-mahesh-yogi/\">24 August</a>, and the following day <a href=\"/1967/08/25/the-beatles-travel-to-bangor/\">travelled to Bangor in north Wales</a> to attend a conference on Transcendental Meditation. That trip was curtailed after <a href=\"/1967/08/27/interview-in-bangor-wales/\">news broke of the death of their manager Brian Epstein</a>. They returned to London that day.</p><p><a href=\"/gallery/1967-photos/670831-beatles-maharisihi-mahesh-yogi_01/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-129282\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4MDAiIGhlaWdodD0iNTI3IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgODAwIDUyNyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"129282\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/670831-beatles-maharisihi-mahesh-yogi_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670831-beatles-maharisihi-mahesh-yogi_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"2048,1349\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles with Maharishi Mahesh Yogi, 31 August 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670831-beatles-maharisihi-mahesh-yogi_01-960x632.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/670831-beatles-maharisihi-mahesh-yogi_01-960x632.jpg\" alt=\"The Beatles with Maharishi Mahesh Yogi, 31 August 1967\" width=\"800\" height=\"527\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-129282\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670831-beatles-maharisihi-mahesh-yogi_01-960x632.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670831-beatles-maharisihi-mahesh-yogi_01-580x382.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670831-beatles-maharisihi-mahesh-yogi_01-200x132.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670831-beatles-maharisihi-mahesh-yogi_01-768x506.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670831-beatles-maharisihi-mahesh-yogi_01-1536x1012.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670831-beatles-maharisihi-mahesh-yogi_01.jpg 2048w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"></a></p><p>A meditation session was held on 31 August, although the precise location is not known. The only photographer present, Philip Townsend, recalled it being at an address on Abbotsbury Road, W14, but the book <em>The Beatles’ London</em> says the likeliest address was 4 Albert Place, W8.</p><p>Attending the session were The Beatles, <a href=\"/people/jane-asher/\">Jane Asher</a>, <a href=\"/people/maureen-starkey/\">Maureen Starkey</a>, Mike McCartney, and various others. The primary purpose was to receive solace and continue the group’s meditation progress.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1967/08/31/beatles-meditate-with-maharishi-mahesh-yogi-london/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-129278 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/670831-beatles-maharisihi-mahesh-yogi_02/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTEzIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDExMyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"113\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670831-beatles-maharisihi-mahesh-yogi_02-200x113.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles wi